sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Web as Web App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as Primary Database
    participant Cache as Cache Layer

    Web->>API: Submit dashboard refresh request with filters, selected dimensions, pinned widgets, and current viewport preferences
    API->>DB: Load the latest persisted dashboard snapshot together with query planning hints and historical aggregation settings
    DB-->>API: Return dashboard snapshot, materialized view references, and cache invalidation guidance for immediate rendering
    API-->>Web: Return a fully normalized dashboard payload ready for client-side rendering and optimistic interaction updates
